From 1b64e6333fa47f88b3213bee7696655f6188b007 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: rkisp2: Add the colour processing algorithm

Port the RkISP1 colour processing algorithm to the RkISP2 IPA: the
Brightness, Contrast, Saturation and Hue controls program the CPROC
block, with the brightness kept neutral at mid grey when the contrast
changes as the RkISP1 algorithm does, and the block's range flags follow
the colour space range of the stream. List the algorithm in the imx415
tuning.

Assisted-by: LLM
